Schema changes are managed with Alembic.

Apply migrations before starting the API:
    alembic upgrade head

For Docker Compose:
    docker compose run --rm backend alembic upgrade head

The initial baseline creates missing tables and adopts existing installations
without dropping or replacing their application data. Future schema changes
should be added as new, explicit revision files and must not edit the baseline.

Inspect the current revision with:
    alembic current
